      "kind": "source_span",
      "layer": "source_span",
      "summary": "46. 3D Gaussian Ray Tracing — 🟢 자체 CUDA — [gaussiantracer.github.io](https://gaussiantracer.github.io/)",
      "detail": "```cuda\n// 3D Gaussian Ray Tracing: ray-particle intersection\n// Splatting: Gaussian → image plane projection\n// Ray Tracing: ray → Gaussian intersection test\n\n__global__ void raytrace_kernel(Ray* rays, Gaussian* gaussians, ...) {\nRay ray = rays[ray_idx];\n\n// BVH traversal로 ray-Gaussian intersection 후보 탐색\nwhile (node = bvh_traverse(ray)) {\nfor (gid in node.primitive_range) {\n// Ray-Gaussian intersection: 3D Mahalanobis distance\nfloat3 d = ray.origin - gaussian.mean;\nfloat t = /* solve quadratic for intersection */;\nif (t > 0 && t < ray.tmax) {\nfloat rho = /* Mahalanobis distance at intersection */;\nfloat alpha = gaussian.opacity * expf(-0.5f * rho);\n// ... accumulate ...\n}\n}\n}\n}\n```",
      "title": "46. 3D Gaussian Ray Tracing — 🟢 자체 CUDA — [gaussiantracer.github.io](https://gaussiantracer.github.io/)",
      "text": "```cuda\n// 3D Gaussian Ray Tracing: ray-particle intersection\n// Splatting: Gaussian → image plane projection\n// Ray Tracing: ray → Gaussian intersection test\n\n__global__ void raytrace_kernel(Ray* rays, Gaussian* gaussians, ...) {\nRay ray = rays[ray_idx];\n\n// BVH traversal로 ray-Gaussian intersection 후보 탐색\nwhile (node = bvh_traverse(ray)) {\nfor (gid in node.primitive_range) {\n// Ray-Gaussian intersection: 3D Mahalanobis distance\nfloat3 d = ray.origin - gaussian.mean;\nfloat t = /* solve quadratic for intersection */;\nif (t > 0 && t < ray.tmax) {\nfloat rho = /* Mahalanobis distance at intersection */;\nfloat alpha = gaussian.opacity * expf(-0.5f * rho);\n// ... accumulate ...\n}\n}\n}\n}\n```",
